" kamerasensor (\\ :ref:`fir/Lepton-ändringen <v4_8_0_fir>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:304
msgid ""
"Replace any ``buzzer`` use with :class:`machine.PWM` (:ref:`the buzzer "
"removal <v4_8_0_buzzer>`)."
msgstr ""
"Ersätt all användning av ``buzzer`` med :class:`machine.PWM` (\\ "
":ref:`borttagningen av buzzer <v4_8_0_buzzer>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:306
msgid ""
"Remove ``omv.disable_fb()`` calls (:ref:`the omv.disable_fb() removal "
"<v4_8_0_omv_fb>`)."
msgstr ""
